%SIXMD 1
# @?SIX2ASCII - CONVERT S6REC TEXT TO CHARACTER LINES

## DESCRIPTION

READS S6REC RECORDS FROM STANDARD INPUT AND WRITES CHARACTER LINES.

USAGE IS 'SIX2ASCII'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/SIX2ASCII
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/SIX2ASCII.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

